# The build context is what gets handed to the daemon, and a context that is "everything" is both slow
# and dangerous: a stray copy of somebody's home directory once landed here, certificates and all.
# Name what belongs in an image; refuse the rest.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!docker-entrypoint.sh
!src
!web
!scripts
!rules
!examples
